  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-9",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 128,
   "width": 777,
   "height": 28,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 71271,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 942561,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "The rule: N’s best path must be cheaper than any path through S",
   "originalText": "The rule: N’s best path must be cheaper than any path through S",
   "fontSize": 22,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-10",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 166,
   "width": 551,
   "height": 23,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 79190,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1047290,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "loop-free   ⇔   dist(N,D)  <  dist(N,S) + dist(S,D)",
   "originalText": "loop-free   ⇔   dist(N,D)  <  dist(N,S) + dist(S,D)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-11",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 199,
   "width": 943,
   "height": 107,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 87109,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1152019,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  The right side is N’s cheapest path to D that goes through S: N → … → S, then S’s own path to D.\n•  If N’s real best path is strictly cheaper, N doesn’t go through S, so traffic S hands to N never\n   comes back.\n•  A tie (=) fails: N might pick the path through S (ECMP), so S can’t count on it.\n•  This is the only check an LFA must pass. B4 and B5 are stronger, optional ones.",
   "originalText": "•  The right side is N’s cheapest path to D that goes through S: N → … → S, then S’s own path to D.\n•  If N’s real best path is strictly cheaper, N doesn’t go through S, so traffic S hands to N never\n   comes back.\n•  A tie (=) fails: N might pick the path through S (ECMP), so S can’t count on it.\n•  This is the only check an LFA must pass. B4 and B5 are stronger, optional ones.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-12",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 316,
   "width": 330,
   "height": 24,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 95028,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1256748,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "originalText": "Worked checks (from the engine)",
   "fontSize": 19,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-13",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 350,
   "width": 664,
   "height": 123,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 102947,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1361477,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example        S → D      N    dist(N,D)  dist(N,S) + dist(S,D)   Result\n-------------  ---------  ---  ---------  ----------------------  -------------\n2  ring        S → E      A    2          1 + 1  = 2              2 = 2    ✗\n2  ring        S → C      A    2          1 + 2  = 3              2 < 3    ✓\n1  square      S → D      N    10         15 + 20 = 35            10 < 35  ✓\n4  ISP core    PE1 → P4   P1   20         10 + 20 = 30            20 < 30  ✓\n4  ISP core    PE1 → P1   P2   20         10 + 10 = 20            20 = 20  ✗",
   "originalText": "Example        S → D      N    dist(N,D)  dist(N,S) + dist(S,D)   Result\n-------------  ---------  ---  ---------  ----------------------  -------------\n2  ring        S → E      A    2          1 + 1  = 2              2 = 2    ✗\n2  ring        S → C      A    2          1 + 2  = 3              2 < 3    ✓\n1  square      S → D      N    10         15 + 20 = 35            10 < 35  ✓\n4  ISP core    PE1 → P4   P1   20         10 + 20 = 30            20 < 30  ✓\n4  ISP core    PE1 → P1   P2   20         10 + 10 = 20            20 = 20  ✗",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 483,
   "width": 977,
   "height": 60,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 110866,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1466206,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Example 4, PE1 → P4 (primary via P2): P1 reaches P4 over the diagonal P1→P4 = 20. Back the other way it costs\n40. If it were 40 both ways, dist(P1,P4) would be 30 (P1 → PE1 → P2 → P4) and 30 < 30 fails. The test is per\ndirection.",
   "originalText": "Example 4, PE1 → P4 (primary via P2): P1 reaches P4 over the diagonal P1→P4 = 20. Back the other way it costs\n40. If it were 40 both ways, dist(P1,P4) would be 30 (P1 → PE1 → P2 → P4) and 30 < 30 fails. The test is per\ndirection.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "b03-text-15",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 638,
   "y": 553,
   "width": 932,
   "height": 40,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 118785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1570935,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Over the whole ring, LFA protects 50% of the (destination, link) pairs. The rest need Remote LFA (A3) or\nTI-LFA (A5).",
   "originalText": "Over the whole ring, LFA protects 50% of the (destination, link) pairs. The rest need Remote LFA (A3) or\nTI-LFA (A5).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
