  {
   "id": "b03-text-52",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1125,
   "y": 817,
   "width": 496,
   "height": 170,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 411788,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 5445908,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "•  Overload bit on S (A17): N can’t pass through S,\n   so the right side is ∞ and the check passes.\n•  Max metric or excluded neighbor (B6): skipped\n   before this check.\n•  Parallel links (A10): another link to E itself is\n   loop-free, since dist(E,D) < dist(E,S) +\n   dist(S,D).\n•  Other ECMP next hops are candidates too (B2).",
   "originalText": "•  Overload bit on S (A17): N can’t pass through S,\n   so the right side is ∞ and the check passes.\n•  Max metric or excluded neighbor (B6): skipped\n   before this check.\n•  Parallel links (A10): another link to E itself is\n   loop-free, since dist(E,D) < dist(E,S) +\n   dist(S,D).\n•  Other ECMP next hops are candidates too (B2).",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
